<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: ARC upgrade fuel multiplier (lower means less fuel needed)-->
  <VQEG_ARCFuelMultiplier>ARC 升级燃油倍增器（较低意味着需要的燃油较少）</VQEG_ARCFuelMultiplier>
  <!--EN: When upgrading the ARC, there are some times when the player needs to burn a given amount of fuel before being allowed to do the upgrades (eg "the ARC needs to burn X wood before being upgraded"). This setting will apply a multiplier to those amount. Bear in mind a lower number means less fuel is needed. A higher number will mean more fuel.-->
  <VQEG_ARCFuelMultiplierTooltip>当升级ARC时，有时玩家需要燃烧一定量的燃料才能进行升级（例如“ARC在升级之前需要燃烧X木材”）。此设置将对这些金额应用乘数。请记住，数字越低意味着需要的燃料越少。数字越高意味着燃料越多。</VQEG_ARCFuelMultiplierTooltip>
  <!--EN: ARC upgrade timer multiplier (lower means faster)-->
  <VQEG_ARCTimersMultiplier>ARC升级定时器乘数（越低意味着越快）</VQEG_ARCTimersMultiplier>
  <!--EN: When upgrading the ARC, there are a series of time periods the player needs to respect before being allowed to do the upgrades (eg "the ARC needs to run for X days in this mode before being upgraded"). This setting will apply a multiplier to those periods. Bear in mind a lower number means things will go faster. A higher number will mean the ARC will take longer.-->
  <VQEG_ARCTimersMultiplierTooltip>升级 ARC 时，玩家在被允许进行升级之前需要遵守一系列时间段（例如“升级之前 ARC 需要在此模式下运行 X 天”）。此设置将对这些期间应用乘数。请记住，数字越低意味着事情会进展得更快。数字越大意味着 ARC 需要的时间越长。</VQEG_ARCTimersMultiplierTooltip>
  <!--EN: Disable the need of a steam vent to build an ARC-->
  <VQEG_DisableNeedForSteamVent>无需蒸汽出口即可构建 ARC</VQEG_DisableNeedForSteamVent>
  <!--EN: By default, you will need a steam vent present in the map to build your ARC. With this mod option active, you can build them anywhere. Useful for gravships, for example.-->
  <VQEG_DisableNeedForSteamVentTooltip>默认情况下，您需要地图中存在蒸汽口来构建 ARC。激活此 mod 选项后，您可以在任何地方构建它们。例如，对于重力船很有用。</VQEG_DisableNeedForSteamVentTooltip>
  <!--EN: Reset-->
  <VQEG_Reset>重置</VQEG_Reset>
  <!--EN: This ability needs to target an advanced component.-->
  <VQE_AbilityNeedsComponent>这种能力需要针对高级组件。</VQE_AbilityNeedsComponent>
  <!--EN: ARC maintenance critical-->
  <VQE_Alert_CriticalMaintenance>ARC 维护至关重要</VQE_Alert_CriticalMaintenance>
  <!--EN: ARC requires urgent maintenance. If no maintenance is performed, the ARC will critically break down.-->
  <VQE_Alert_CriticalMaintenance_Desc>ARC 需要紧急维护。如果不进行维护，ARC 将严重损坏。</VQE_Alert_CriticalMaintenance_Desc>
  <!--EN: ARC maintenance low-->
  <VQE_Alert_LowMaintenance>ARC 维护成本低</VQE_Alert_LowMaintenance>
  <!--EN: ARC requires maintenance. If no maintenance is performed, the ARC will critically break down.-->
  <VQE_Alert_LowMaintenance_Desc>ARC 需要维护。如果不进行维护，ARC 将严重损坏。</VQE_Alert_LowMaintenance_Desc>
  <!--EN: ARC low on uranium-->
  <VQE_Alert_LowUranium>ARC 低铀含量</VQE_Alert_LowUranium>
  <!--EN: ARC is about to run out of uranium. When it does, it will become disabled until the restart procedures are initiated.-->
  <VQE_Alert_LowUranium_Desc>ARC 的铀即将耗尽。当它出现时，它将被禁用，直到启动重新启动过程。</VQE_Alert_LowUranium_Desc>
  <!--EN: calibrate components-->
  <VQE_CalibrateComponents>校准组件</VQE_CalibrateComponents>
  <!--EN: Force a soft breakdown of the ARC, requiring parts of the core to be refurbished, in order to upgrade the internal workings of the core and improve the longevity of the components by 10%.-->
  <VQE_CalibrateComponentsDesc>强制ARC发生软故障，需要对部分核心进行翻新，以升级核心的内部运作，并将组件的寿命提高10%。</VQE_CalibrateComponentsDesc>
  <!--EN: \n\nCalibrate components has a {0} cooldown. It will be ready again in {1}-->
  <VQE_CalibrateComponentsDescExtended>校准组件有 {0} 冷却时间。将于 {1} 内再次准备就绪</VQE_CalibrateComponentsDescExtended>
  <!--EN: calibrate efficiency-->
  <VQE_CalibrateEfficiency>校准效率</VQE_CalibrateEfficiency>
  <!--EN: Set the ARC into a low-power mode to calibrate its efficiency. While the fuel consumption will not change in the low-power mode, upon completion of the calibration, the power output will permanently increase by 1%.-->
  <VQE_CalibrateEfficiencyDesc>将 ARC 设置为低功耗模式以校准其效率。虽然低功耗模式下油耗不会变化，但校准完成后，功率输出将永久增加1%。</VQE_CalibrateEfficiencyDesc>
  <!--EN: \n\nThe efficiency calibration has a {0} cooldown. It will be ready again in {1}-->
  <VQE_CalibrateEfficiencyDescExtended>效率校准有 {0} 冷却时间。将于 {1} 内再次准备就绪</VQE_CalibrateEfficiencyDescExtended>
  <!--EN: calibrate fuel rods-->
  <VQE_CalibrateFuelRods>校准燃料棒</VQE_CalibrateFuelRods>
  <!--EN: Temporarily shut down the reactor to calibrate the fuel consumption, allowing each unit of uranium to provide power for a longer time. Each calibration of fuel rods will reduce the fuel consumption rate by 10% of the remaining value.-->
  <VQE_CalibrateFuelRodsDesc>暂时关闭反应堆以校准燃料消耗，让每个单位的铀能够提供更长时间的电力。每校准一次燃料棒，燃料消耗率就会减少剩余值的10%。</VQE_CalibrateFuelRodsDesc>
  <!--EN: \n\nCalibrate fuel rods has a {0} cooldown. It will be ready again in {1}-->
  <VQE_CalibrateFuelRodsDescExtended>校准燃料棒有 {0} 冷却时间。将于 {1} 内再次准备就绪</VQE_CalibrateFuelRodsDescExtended>
  <!--EN: Critical breakdown-->
  <VQE_CriticalBreakdown>严重故障</VQE_CriticalBreakdown>
  <!--EN: ARC maintenance: {0}-->
  <VQE_CurrentMaintenance>ARC 维护：{0}</VQE_CurrentMaintenance>
  <!--EN: Downgrade to {0}-->
  <VQE_DowngradeGenetron>降级至 {0}</VQE_DowngradeGenetron>
  <!--EN: Downgrade the ARC to an earlier stage of construction.-->
  <VQE_DowngradeGenetronDesc>将 ARC 降级到施工的早期阶段。</VQE_DowngradeGenetronDesc>
  <!--EN: Warning, this will downgrade the ARC to {0}. All materials used to upgrade it to the current stage will be lost. Are you sure you want to proceed?-->
  <VQE_DowngradeGenetronDialog>警告，这会将 ARC 降级为 {0}。用于升级到当前阶段的所有材料都会丢失。您确定要继续吗？</VQE_DowngradeGenetronDialog>
  <!--EN: It's not possible to downgrade the ARC during a meltdown.-->
  <VQE_DowngradeGenetronMeltdown>在熔毁期间不可能降低 ARC 的等级。</VQE_DowngradeGenetronMeltdown>
  <!--EN: emergency shut-down-->
  <VQE_EmergencyShutDown>紧急关闭</VQE_EmergencyShutDown>
  <!--EN: Shut down the ARC. It will stop burning uranium, thus stopping the maintenance loss. It will also stop generating power until restart procedures are initiated.-->
  <VQE_EmergencyShutDownDesc>关闭 ARC。它将停止燃烧铀，从而停止维护损失。它还将停止发电，直到启动重启程序。</VQE_EmergencyShutDownDesc>
  <!--EN: \n\nReactor is off now.-->
  <VQE_EmergencyShutDownDescExtended>Reactor 现已关闭。</VQE_EmergencyShutDownDescExtended>
  <!--EN: You've stayed in the village too long. The people of {FACTION_name} are attacking!-->
  <VQE_FactionBecameHostileTimed>你在村里呆得太久了。 {FACTION_name} 的人民正在进攻！</VQE_FactionBecameHostileTimed>
  <!--EN: Projected fuel burn rate: {0} per day-->
  <VQE_FuelConsumptionProjected>预计燃油消耗率：每天 {0}</VQE_FuelConsumptionProjected>
  <!--EN: Current fuel burn rate: {0} per day-->
  <VQE_FuelRateAtTheMoment>当前燃油消耗率：{0} 每天</VQE_FuelRateAtTheMoment>
  <!--EN: ARC fine-tuning-->
  <VQE_GenetronFineTuning>ARC 微调</VQE_GenetronFineTuning>
  <!--EN: Alter the fuel consumption to increase or decrease the power generated by the ARC, and adjust generator maintenance wear to boost the power output.-->
  <VQE_GenetronFineTuningDesc>改变燃料消耗以增加或减少 ARC 产生的功率，并调整发电机维护磨损以提高功率输出。</VQE_GenetronFineTuningDesc>
  <!--EN: ARC maintenance
ARC needs to be maintained by colonists. If maintenance reaches 0%, ARC will break down.-->
  <VQE_GenetronMaintenanceTooltip>ARC 维护
ARC 需要由殖民者维护。如果维护达到0%，ARC就会损坏。</VQE_GenetronMaintenanceTooltip>
  <!--EN: ARC overdrive-->
  <VQE_GenetronOverdrive>ARC 超速</VQE_GenetronOverdrive>
  <!--EN: Put the ARC in a temporary {0} overdrive mode. It will rapidly burn through fuel, generating significantly more energy. If at any point during the overdrive the fuel runs out, the generator will break down and require refurbishing with ARC components.-->
  <VQE_GenetronOverdriveDesc>将 ARC 置于临时 {0} 超速模式。它将迅速燃烧燃料，产生更多的能量。如果在超速行驶过程中的任何时候燃料耗尽，发电机就会发生故障并需要使用 ARC 组件进行翻新。</VQE_GenetronOverdriveDesc>
  <!--EN: \n\nOverdrive has a {0} cooldown. It will be ready again in {1}-->
  <VQE_GenetronOverdriveDescExtended>超速有 {0} 冷却时间。将于 {1} 内再次准备就绪</VQE_GenetronOverdriveDescExtended>
  <!--EN: ARC pressure-->
  <VQE_GenetronPressureLabel>电弧压力</VQE_GenetronPressureLabel>
  <!--EN: pressure tuning-->
  <VQE_GenetronSteamTuning>压力调节</VQE_GenetronSteamTuning>
  <!--EN: Alter the pressure of the ARC, affecting the wear and tear of components and the power output.-->
  <VQE_GenetronSteamTuningDesc>改变ARC的压力，影响元件的磨损和功率输出。</VQE_GenetronSteamTuningDesc>
  <!--EN: set maintenance loss per day to: {0}%-->
  <VQE_GenetronSteamTuningMaintenance>将每日维护损失设置为：{0}%</VQE_GenetronSteamTuningMaintenance>
  <!--EN: ARC tuning-->
  <VQE_GenetronTuning>ARC 调校</VQE_GenetronTuning>
  <!--EN: Alter the fuel consumption to increase or decrease the power generated by the ARC.-->
  <VQE_GenetronTuningDesc>改变燃料消耗以增加或减少 ARC 产生的功率。</VQE_GenetronTuningDesc>
  <!--EN: Projected power output: {0} Wd-->
  <VQE_GenetronTuningProjected>预计功率输出：{0} Wd</VQE_GenetronTuningProjected>
  <!--EN: set ARC output to: {0}%-->
  <VQE_GenetronTuningSet>将 ARC 输出设置为：{0}%</VQE_GenetronTuningSet>
  <!--EN: {0} has thoroughly studied the {1}-->
  <VQE_HasStudied>{0} 已彻底研究了 {1}</VQE_HasStudied>
  <!--EN: hazard mode-->
  <VQE_HazardMode>危险模式</VQE_HazardMode>
  <!--EN: The ARC operates in hazard mode. Burning uranium emits an unhealthy amount of radiation in radius, generating toxic buildup to everyone caught in it without toxic-resistant gear. The radius depends on the amount of uranium in the ARC. Maintenance of the ARC does not decrease. Activating this ability will change the ARC to operate in safe mode.-->
  <VQE_HazardModeDesc>ARC 在危险模式下运行。燃烧的铀会在半径范围内释放出不健康的辐射量，对其中没有防毒装备的每个人捕获产生有毒物质累积。半径取决于 ARC 中铀的含量。 ARC的维护并没有减少。激活此功能会将 ARC 更改为在安全模式下运行。</VQE_HazardModeDesc>
  <!--EN: Operating in hazard mode.-->
  <VQE_HazardModeInfo>在危险模式下运行。</VQE_HazardModeInfo>
  <!--EN: install emergency shut-off systems-->
  <VQE_InstallAtomicGenetron>安装紧急关闭系统</VQE_InstallAtomicGenetron>
  <!--EN: Install a system that instantly shuts down the reactor in dangerous situations, avoiding catastrophic failures and giving time for repairs. Additional safety mechanisms also allow anyone to maintain the atomic ARC, not just those who studied the ancient variants.-->
  <VQE_InstallAtomicGenetronDesc>安装一个在危险情况下立即关闭反应堆的系统，避免灾难性故障并留出修复时间。额外的安全机制还允许任何人维护原子 ARC，而不仅仅是那些研究古代变体的人。</VQE_InstallAtomicGenetronDesc>
  <!--EN: \n\nARC needs to operate uninterrupted in hazard mode for {0} (time at the moment: {1})-->
  <VQE_InstallAtomicGenetronDescExpanded>ARC 需要在危险模式下不间断运行 {0}（时刻：{1}）</VQE_InstallAtomicGenetronDescExpanded>
  <!--EN: install hyperburn chamber-->
  <VQE_InstallChemfuelBoostedGenetron>安装超燃烧室</VQE_InstallChemfuelBoostedGenetron>
  <!--EN: Install a hyperburn chamber to superheat the combustion process and extract maximum energy from each unit of fuel.-->
  <VQE_InstallChemfuelBoostedGenetronDesc>安装超燃烧室以使燃烧过程过热，并从每单位燃料中提取最大能量。</VQE_InstallChemfuelBoostedGenetronDesc>
  <!--EN: \n\nARC overdrive needs to be active for {0} days. (time at the moment: {1})-->
  <VQE_InstallChemfuelBoostedGenetronDescExpanded>ARC 超速需要激活 {0} 天。 （时刻 的时间：{1}）</VQE_InstallChemfuelBoostedGenetronDescExpanded>
  <!--EN: install adaptive fuel modulator-->
  <VQE_InstallChemfuelChargedGenetron>安装自适应燃油调节器</VQE_InstallChemfuelChargedGenetron>
  <!--EN: Install an adaptive fuel modulator to adjust fuel flow dynamically, matching power demands and optimizing fuel usage. This ensures extended runtime and peak efficiency without sacrificing energy output.-->
  <VQE_InstallChemfuelChargedGenetronDesc>安装自适应燃油调节器以动态调节燃油流量，满足电力需求并优化燃油使用。这确保了延长运行时间和峰值效率，而不牺牲能量输出。</VQE_InstallChemfuelChargedGenetronDesc>
  <!--EN: \n\nPower surge needs to be activated {0} times. (activations at the moment: {1})-->
  <VQE_InstallChemfuelChargedGenetronDescExpanded>电涌需要激活 {0} 次。 （在 时刻 激活：{1}）</VQE_InstallChemfuelChargedGenetronDescExpanded>
  <!--EN: install ignition stabilizer-->
  <VQE_InstallChemfuelFortifiedGenetron>安装点火稳定器</VQE_InstallChemfuelFortifiedGenetron>
  <!--EN: Install an ignition stabilizer gizmo to ensure consistent and steady combustion, maintaining optimal power output and reducing fluctuations in fuel consumption. This upgrade enhances the generator's reliability and fuel efficiency. The stabilizer can be calibrated to permanently improve the power output.-->
  <VQE_InstallChemfuelFortifiedGenetronDesc>安装点火稳定器小装置，以确保持续稳定的燃烧，保持最佳的功率输出并减少燃油消耗的波动。此次升级提高了发电机的可靠性和燃油效率。可以校准稳定器以永久提高功率输出。</VQE_InstallChemfuelFortifiedGenetronDesc>
  <!--EN: \n\nARC needs to burn {0} fuel (fuel burned at the moment: {1})-->
  <VQE_InstallChemfuelFortifiedGenetronDescExpanded>ARC 需要燃烧 {0} 燃料（燃料在 时刻: {1} 燃烧）</VQE_InstallChemfuelFortifiedGenetronDescExpanded>
  <!--EN: install chemfuel-powered ARC core-->
  <VQE_InstallChemfuelPoweredGenetron>安装由 chemfuel 驱动的 ARC 核心</VQE_InstallChemfuelPoweredGenetron>
  <!--EN: Install a set of chemfuel-operated engines that power up the ARC core, providing large quantities of energy by burning chemfuel. The engines will need regular maintenance, and if they break down, will require ARC components to be replaced.-->
  <VQE_InstallChemfuelPoweredGenetronDesc>安装一组化学燃料驱动的发动机，为 ARC 核心提供动力，通过燃烧化学燃料提供大量能量。发动机需要定期维护，如果出现故障，则需要更换 ARC 部件。</VQE_InstallChemfuelPoweredGenetronDesc>
  <!--EN: \n\nARC needs to operate at 200% using ARC tuning uninterrupted for {0} days. (time at the moment: {1})-->
  <VQE_InstallChemfuelPoweredGenetronDescExpanded>ARC 需要使用 ARC 调整不间断地以 200% 运行 {0} 天。 （时刻 的时间：{1}）</VQE_InstallChemfuelPoweredGenetronDescExpanded>
  <!--EN: \n\nRequires Biofuel refining research to be completed.-->
  <VQE_InstallChemfuelPoweredGenetronDescNoResearch>需要完成生物燃料精炼研究。</VQE_InstallChemfuelPoweredGenetronDescNoResearch>
  <!--EN: install geothermal ARC core-->
  <VQE_InstallGeothermalGenetron>安装地热ARC核心</VQE_InstallGeothermalGenetron>
  <!--EN: Exchange the ARC core to utilise exclusively the steam energy produced by the geothermal vent. Doing so will decrease the power output significantly, but will also remove any fuel need completely. Geothermal ARC core will require regular maintenance, but can be maintained by everyone and not just the ARC specialists.-->
  <VQE_InstallGeothermalGenetronDesc>更换 ARC 核心以专门利用地热喷口产生的蒸汽能。这样做会显着降低功率输出，但也会完全消除任何燃料需求。地热 ARC 核心需要定期维护，但每个人都可以维护，而不仅仅是 ARC 专家。</VQE_InstallGeothermalGenetronDesc>
  <!--EN: \n\nRequires Geothermal power research to be completed.-->
  <VQE_InstallGeothermalGenetronDescNoResearch>需要完成地热发电研究。</VQE_InstallGeothermalGenetronDescNoResearch>
  <!--EN: \n\nA colonist needs to study an ancient geothermal ARC somewhere in the world.-->
  <VQE_InstallGeothermalGenetronDescNoStudied>殖民者需要研究世界某个地方的古代地热 ARC。</VQE_InstallGeothermalGenetronDescNoStudied>
  <!--EN: install flow regulators-->
  <VQE_InstallHeatPoweredGenetron>安装流量调节器</VQE_InstallHeatPoweredGenetron>
  <!--EN: Install a number of internal steam flow regulators that balance steam intake to ensure consistent performance, reducing wear and tear on the generator's components. Flow regulators allow the generator to operate even during a solar flare.-->
  <VQE_InstallHeatPoweredGenetronDesc>安装多个内部蒸汽流量调节器来平衡蒸汽摄入量，以确保一致的性能，减少发电机组件的磨损。流量调节器使发电机即使在太阳耀斑期间也能运行。</VQE_InstallHeatPoweredGenetronDesc>
  <!--EN: \n\nARC needs to operate uninterrupted for {0} (time at the moment: {1})-->
  <VQE_InstallHeatPoweredGenetronDescExpanded>ARC 需要不间断运行 {0}（时刻：{1}）</VQE_InstallHeatPoweredGenetronDescExpanded>
  <!--EN: install radiation shielding-->
  <VQE_InstallIsotopicGenetron>安装辐射屏蔽</VQE_InstallIsotopicGenetron>
  <!--EN: Install advanced shielding to reduce radiation exposure in nearby areas, making it safer for colonists when the reactor operates in unsafe mode.-->
  <VQE_InstallIsotopicGenetronDesc>安装先进的屏蔽装置以减少附近区域的辐射暴露，使反应堆在不安全模式下运行时殖民者更加安全。</VQE_InstallIsotopicGenetronDesc>
  <!--EN: \n\nARC needs to burn {0} uranium (uranium burned at the moment: {1})-->
  <VQE_InstallIsotopicGenetronDescExpanded>ARC需要燃烧{0}铀（在时刻燃烧的铀：{1}）</VQE_InstallIsotopicGenetronDescExpanded>
  <!--EN: install uranium enrichment chamber-->
  <VQE_InstallNuclearGenetron>安装铀浓缩室</VQE_InstallNuclearGenetron>
  <!--EN: Install a chamber that allows you to slow down the decay rate of uranium, allowing it to generate power for a longer time.-->
  <VQE_InstallNuclearGenetronDesc>安装一个可以减慢铀衰变速度的室，使其能够更长时间地发电。</VQE_InstallNuclearGenetronDesc>
  <!--EN: \n\nUranium-powered ARC needs to be restarted. To do that, it needs to burn all uranium and shut down due to lack of fuel.-->
  <VQE_InstallNuclearGenetronDescExpanded>铀驱动的 ARC 需要重新启动。为此，它需要燃烧所有铀并因缺乏燃料而关闭。</VQE_InstallNuclearGenetronDescExpanded>
  <!--EN: install vent booster-->
  <VQE_InstallSteamPoweredGenetron>安装通风增压器</VQE_InstallSteamPoweredGenetron>
  <!--EN: Install a thermal vent booster to enhance steam flow from geothermal vents, boosting the ARC’s power output during peak energy demands. This upgrade ensures higher efficiency and performance when needed most.-->
  <VQE_InstallSteamPoweredGenetronDesc>安装热通风口增压器以增强地热通风口的蒸汽流量，从而在能源需求高峰期间提高 ARC 的功率输出。此升级可确保在最需要时提供更高的效率和性能。</VQE_InstallSteamPoweredGenetronDesc>
  <!--EN: \n\nARC needs to operate uninterrupted for {0} (time at the moment: {1})-->
  <VQE_InstallSteamPoweredGenetronDescExpanded>ARC 需要不间断运行 {0}（时刻：{1}）</VQE_InstallSteamPoweredGenetronDescExpanded>
  <!--EN: install pressure surge protectors-->
  <VQE_InstallThermalVentGenetron>安装压力浪涌保护器</VQE_InstallThermalVentGenetron>
  <!--EN: Install a set of pressure surge protectors that will prevent the ARC from ever reaching a critical breaking point, while also increasing the power output.-->
  <VQE_InstallThermalVentGenetronDesc>安装一组压力浪涌保护器，以防止 ARC 达到临界点，同时增加功率输出。</VQE_InstallThermalVentGenetronDesc>
  <!--EN: \n\nSteam boost needs to be activated {0} times. (activations at the moment: {1})-->
  <VQE_InstallThermalVentGenetronDescExpanded>蒸汽增强需要激活 {0} 次。 （在 时刻 激活：{1}）</VQE_InstallThermalVentGenetronDescExpanded>
