  <!--EN: The creator of the ARC has turned out to be a traitor: {0} has been spreading their beliefs, convincing others to embrace an ideology that rejects technology. They have formed a new ideology: {1}. They argue that dependence on the ARC is reckless and will doom the colony. Their growing following now views the ARC as a threat, and whispers of sabotage have begun to surface. Left unchecked, this movement could escalate into conflict, putting your colony’s survival at risk.\n\nFollowing colonists have adopted {1}: {2}\n\nFollowers of {1} will refuse to do research. They will be unhappy if equipped with industrial-tech level or higher apparel and weapons, and will target technological items in their tantrums. Their priority will be destroying the ARC generator, and they will dislike anyone who holds the knowledge how to construct one of them.\n\nYou can consider exiling these colonists, or converting them back to their previous ideology.-->
  <VQE_TraitorSchismDesc>ARC 的创建者被证明是一个叛徒：{0} 一直在传播他们的信仰，说服其他人接受拒绝技术的意识形态。他们形成了一种新的意识形态：{1}。他们认为，对 ARC 的依赖是鲁莽的，将会毁灭这个殖民地。他们越来越多的追随者现在将 ARC 视为威胁，并且破坏活动的谣言已经开始浮出水面。如果不加以控制，这一运动可能会升级为冲突，使您的殖民地的生存面临风险。

以下殖民者已采用{1}：{2}

{1}的追随者将拒绝进行研究。如果装备了工业科技级别或更高的服装和武器，他们会不高兴，并且会针对科​​技物品发脾气。他们的首要任务是摧毁 ARC 发生器，并且他们会不喜欢任何拥有如何建造其中一台发生器的知识的人。

你可以考虑放逐这些殖民者，或者将他们转变回以前的意识形态。</VQE_TraitorSchismDesc>
